  "version": "V0.29.57",
  "theme": "ARCH-033/034 -- AK09916 axis map and body frame",
  "description": "The magnetometer die sits in a different orientation from the accel/gyro dies and no transform was applied, so every heading ever published came from a vector in the wrong frame. ARCH-033 maps the axes at the sensor seam (GPS truth: R 0.170 -> 0.861). ARCH-034 returns IMU_BODY_FRAME to the identity, removing the ~115 deg offset and correcting grade, pitch and g-force. Awaiting in-car validation."
}
